" Birleşen kayıt silinmez: \"Birleşti\" durumunda kapanır, klasöründe "
"yalnız yönlendirme notu kalır."
msgstr ""
"The documents of the merged record move to the remaining record's folder "
"under its name (K8); document numbers, name spellings, contact details, "
"field sources and document packages are attached to the remaining record,"
" and duplicate values are kept once. The merged record is not deleted: it"
" is closed with the status \"Merged\" and only a redirect note stays in "
"its folder."

